_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1210306003:0":{"text":"네. ","source_cn":"是。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x485CFF86C2310EED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:13::0":{"text":"뼈와 발톱이 그려진 낡은 깃발","source_cn":"画着骨头和利爪的破旧旗帜","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x596E97F5296A42B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1210306004:0":{"text":"...저건 우리가 찾은 배에 달려 있던 깃발이에요!","source_cn":"——那是我们找到的船上的旗子！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9D1F64846B73206","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1210306005:0":{"text":"이건 <style=\"highlight\">물귀신파의 깃발</style>이야.","source_cn":"这是<style=highlight>水鬼帮的旗帜</...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC88ECC8A7210CECF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1210306006:1":{"text":"너희는 물귀신파의 배를 타고 러스트 항에 온 데다가 벌목장에서 우리 순찰대를 다치게 했어. 무슨 할 말이 더 있지?","source_cn":"你们乘着水鬼帮的船来到锈锚港，又在伐木场打伤了我们的巡...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63E37A3F4BAC2CBD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:19:1210306006":{"text":"너희는 물귀신파의 배를 타고 러스트 항에 온 데다가 벌목장에서 우리 순찰대를 다치게 했어. 무슨 할 말이 더 있지?","source_cn":"你们乘着水鬼帮的船来到锈锚港，又在伐木场打伤了我们的巡查队。还有什么想说的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63E37A3F4BAC2CBD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1210306007:1":{"text":"우리가 잡아들인 물귀신은 다들 그렇게 말하더군. 하지만 현명한 사람이라면 지금은 용서를 구해도, 후회해도 소용없다는 걸 잘 알고 있겠지.","source_cn":"每一个被抓住的水鬼都这么说。但聪明的人应该知道，这时候...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9F123E999E094708","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1210306008:1":{"text":"너희랑 한패가 누군지, 러스트 항에 숨어든 목적이 뭔지 말한다면 고생을 좀 덜 수 있을 거다.","source_cn":"供出你的同伙，说出你们潜入锈锚港的目的，或许你能少受点罪。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A4EB569C210C28A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1210306009:1":{"text":"...말 안 해? 물귀신파에 너처럼 독한 녀석은 드문데.","source_cn":"……不说吗？水鬼帮倒是少见你这样的倔骨头。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF48A65E2F22F513","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1210306010:1":{"text":"루카, 두 쥐의 입을 비틀어 버려.","source_cn":"卢卡，撬开那两只小老鼠的嘴。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE3299626B700184","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:24:1210306010":{"text":"루카, 두 쥐의 입을 비틀어 버려.","source_cn":"卢卡，撬开那两只小老鼠的嘴。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE3299626B700184","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1210306011:0":{"text":"현명한 자로군.","source_cn":"聪明人。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD4EB4C1A6A8B950C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"현명한 자로군.","female":"현명한 자로군.","variant_male_record_index":"127870","variant_female_record_index":"127871","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:26:1210306011":{"text":"현명한 자로군.","source_cn":"聪明人。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD4EB4C1A6A8B950C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"현명한 자로군.","female":"현명한 자로군.","variant_male_record_index":"127870","variant_female_record_index":"127871","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1210306012:0":{"text":"...우으으읍!!!","source_cn":"——唔唔唔！！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB4B6BCFF2E4E76B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1210306013:0":{"text":"루카, 입에 재갈을 풀어줘.","source_cn":"卢卡，把他们嘴里的布拿开。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAB8B963EB8A0B365","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1210306014:0":{"text":"우린 정말 물귀신이 아니에요. 신밧드... 신밧드가 증명할 수 있어요!","source_cn":"我们真的不是水鬼，辛巴达——辛巴达能证明！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x234B2C23B5F01BE6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1210306015:0":{"text":"그가 해안가에서 우리를 구해주고 게스트 하우스도 소개해 줬어요. 물고기가 있는 방향을 알려준 것도 신밧드예요! 요 며칠 우리가 무얼 했는지 가장 잘 아는지 사람이 바로 신밧드라고요!","source_cn":"他在海岸边救了我们，给我们介绍了旅店，又指了钓鱼的方向...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE62EE87EFC729BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1210306016:1":{"text":"신밧드?","source_cn":"辛巴达？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7BA3A0CDA1260507","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1210306017:1":{"text":"얼굴에 상처가 있는 방정맞은 녀석이 신밧드입니다. <style=\"highlight\">후긴</style>을 추천한 게 그 녀석이었죠.","source_cn":"那个脸上有疤的轻浮小子，<style=highligh...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE8311FAE866A7121","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1210306018:0":{"text":"흥, 러스트 항에선 그 누구의 말도 믿어선 안 돼. 특히 그 녀석 말이라면 더더욱.","source_cn":"哼，锈锚港谁的话都不能信，尤其是他。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x59F17AD0CBCEE55B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1210306019:1":{"text":"좋